  "chain": "legacy wiring defect in secondary disconnect [cause B] -> maintenance manipulation inadvertently completes interlock circuit -> normal feeder breaker 1X7-4D trips -> MCC 1XR loses power (alternate feeder already out for PM) -> loss of power to A train fan AND panelboard 1KG -> loss of power to both A and B train inlet dampers -> both CRVS OABF trains common-cause inoperable (5h26m) [B train restored by manually failing damper open]",
  "golden_questions": [
