    "Q4",
    "Q14"
  ],
  "notes": "Common-cause event: single legacy wiring defect combined with a concurrent, unrelated planned maintenance outage of the alternate feeder (1X6) produced simultaneous loss of both OABF trains via a shared downstream panelboard (1KG) feeding both trains' dampers. No PART_OF asserted from breaker/MCC/panelboard to sys_ed since these are power-supply/functional relationships, not stated containment, except secondary disconnect explicitly described as part of breaker cubicle 1X6-6C. ADS/other ECCS not applicable to this non-ECCS ventilation event."
}